# Flagship paper v1.0+ SHIP PDFs (committed deliberately at milestone Patches;
# working-draft compilation PDFs in deeper subfolders remain ignored)
!flagship_papers/*/*.pdf

# Figure ASSETS are content, not build artifacts (Patch 3309: the GR-1b
# figure PDFs were silently excluded by *.pdf above, so the 3293 repair
# never survived a clone — the paper compiled clean only on the machine
# that generated them)
!**/figures/*.pdf
anaconda_projects/

# Patch 3424: generated gate certificates and evidentiary legs for the
# beta-ladder. Patch 3180 accidentally committed a duplicates_1b_verified.json
# STUB carrying status INCOMPLETE -- an artifact of exercising the refusal
# guard in a container with no data. A gate-result file in the repo reading
# INCOMPLETE is worse than no file: it is a false certificate that a later
# reader could mistake for a real result. Gate status lives in the verdict
# records, which are prose and reviewed; these files are regenerable from
# the legs and are not tracked.
series_phenomena/cosmology/dark_matter/data/beta_ladder/
series_phenomena/cosmology/dark_matter/data/beta_ladder_1b/
series_phenomena/cosmology/dark_matter/data/beta_ladder_void_3173/
series_phenomena/cosmology/dark_matter/analyze_out.txt
series_phenomena/cosmology/dark_matter/verify_out.txt
